---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /articles.html
title: 文章｜赵荣力
description: 浏览赵荣力的旅行、美食、建站与科研软件文章。
activeNav: articles
---
<div class="main-content">
  <div class="blog-lr">
    <div class="blog-left article-grid">
      <header><h1 class="extra-title">文章</h1></header>
      {% for post in collections.article | reverse %}
      <article class="blog-box article-card">
        <a class="article-card-media" href="{{ post.url }}" aria-label="阅读{{ post.data.cardTitle or post.data.title }}">
          <div class="as-image-thumb">
            <span style="padding-bottom: 100%">
              <img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="阅读文章：{{ post.data.cardTitle or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy" width="230" height="180">
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <div class="article-card-copy">
          <p class="as-date__multi">{{ post.data.dateLabel or post.date | formatDate }}<span>/</span> {{ post.data.category or '文章' }}</p>
          <h2 class="as-title__multi"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.cardTitle or post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p class="as-subtitle__multi">{{ post.data.summary or post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
